      "lang": "en",
      "category": "press",
      "file": "static/audio/news/en/export-news-2-11.mp3",
      "text": "BRAC Bank and City Bank have jointly launched ‘Digibox’, an automated smart locker service in Bangladesh, enabling customers to securely drop off and retrieve packages 24/7 using digital self-service lockers.",
